    "summary": "Across Europe and the Middle East, 93% of organisations planned to increase AI investment in 2026, yet fewer than half of AI proofs of concept successfully transition into production. So, if the challenge is moving AI from pilot to production, organisations need proven use cases that can be deployed, governed and scaled with confidence. Lenovo and its ecosystem partners are helping customers apply AI to real-world challenges across industries and accelerate time-to-value with the recently announced Lenovo AI Library use cases that enable selected deployments to reach production in as little as one week. Lenovo AI Services help translate governance requirements into deployment choices as customers combine scalable Hybrid AI infrastructure, an integrated data layer and production inference software.",
