    "summary": "The system will deploy on Astrolab’s FLIP rover for an upcoming mission for the Moon Base program and will test the suitability of advanced computing for future missions and the emerging lunar economy. With 70 years of leadership in space exploration, HPE ushers in a new era by providing the advanced computing foundation for the emerging lunar economy HPE Spaceborne Computer-4 plans to power the first high performance computing benchmarks on the lunar surface HPE Spaceborne Computer-4 will test large language model retrieval-augmented generation, vision inference, and LiDAR data for reliable deployment of AI on the Moon HOUSTON, Texas – Oct. It is equipped with both a low-power central process unit (CPU) and graphics processing unit (GPU). HPE (NYSE: HPE) is a leader in essential enterprise technology, bringing together the power of AI, cloud, and networking to help organizations achieve more.",
