    "publishedAt": "2026-10-21",
    "summary": "BERLIN, Germany — At NVIDIA GTC Berlin, Vertiv Holdings Co. (NYSE: VRT) and NVIDIA today introduced an AI factory approach that combines rapid configuration and virtual validation of pre-engineered reference architectures with factory-built deployment. In the modeled scenario, this reduces the time from requirements to a configured and validated AI factory solution from approximately 30 days to three days, a 10x improvement. In the modeled scenario, the factory-built approach reduces the infrastructure deployment period from approximately 90 days to 45 days, a reduction of up to 50%. Vertiv is supplying prefabricated power and thermal modules, Vertiv™ SmartRun overhead infrastructure and Vertiv™ SmartMod, supported by Vertiv™ Unify software.",
