    "summary": "2TB SanDisk Optimus GX Pro 8100 PCIe 5.0 SSD is down to an all-time low of $349, making it one of the cheapest 2TB Gen5 drives around. Expand your storage with this speedy Sandisk 2TB PCIe 5.0 NVMe SSD that’s only $0.18-cents per GB a]:text-inherit :underline\"> When you purchase through links on our site, we may earn an affiliate commission. For $349 , you can get one of the faster 2TB drives. At less than $ 0.18 per GB, it’s one of the least expensive 2TB PCIe 5.0 drives available right now.",
