    "sourceUrl": "https://pr.ezwire.com/Samtec/2026-11%20-%20Samtec/2026-11-03_Samtec_PR_UMD6-UDF6%20AcceleRate%20mP%2010mm%20SH/2026-11-03_Samtec_PR_UMD6-UDF6%20AcceleRate%20mP%2010mm%20SH.html",
    "publishedAt": "2026-11-03",
    "summary": "3, 2026 — Samtec, Inc., the service leader in the connector industry, announces the release of its 10 mm stack height, AcceleRate &reg; mP ( UDM6 , UDF6 ) combination signal pin and power blade connectors. To reduce crowding in the connector and provide uniform cooling, power blades are positioned parallel to the connector body length. This blade placement is a 90&deg; shift compared to common power systems in the industry and enables optimized heat dissipation with a high current-carrying capacity of up to 15 A per blade and a voltage rating of 200 VAC or 283 VDC. Samtec is a $1 billion global manufacturer of a broad line of electronic interconnect solutions, including High-Speed Board-to-Board, High-Speed Cables, Mid-Board and Panel Optics, Precision RF, Flexible Stacking, and Micro/Rugged components and cables.",
    "whyItMatters": "对立讯的意义在于高速互连从服务器内部延伸到光链路，需观察光器件产能、客户认证和连接方案是否改变。",
